				<wikidot:authorName>VAElynx</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>914331</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I love this , not the least because at least once I have tried writing a sports match involving the use of bizarre magic myself. Maybe a little silly in the sense that a setting where summoning an elder god is sensible in the context of a sports game is really OP.. .but then, who knows what's their standard for an elder god anyhow? Might be rather pathetic, after all.</p> <p>Either way,<br /> Go Alexylva! This announcement was brought to you by the APPOLODORUS CONSTRUCTION COMBINE. APPOLODORUS! Let us let your future build itself!<br /> (Though, I wonder, should the full name have been used somewhere, Alexandria of Forests? I always thought Alexylva was an informal contraction, mostly.)</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
